extra.plannerTopics:
- the `firestore.rules` / `storage.rules` change each new path needs;
- public mirrors of private data, and the backfills they need;
- analytics events to add or change;
- mobile accessibility (accessible, accessibilityLabel, accessibilityRole, contrast) and design tokens / theme to use;
- safe area handling (ScreenWrapper, keyboard avoidance);
- edge cases, offline handling, and concurrency (transactions, batches, races).

extra.reviewerChecks:
- tests for new code; analytics for user-facing changes;
- safe areas and design tokens instead of hardcoded values;
- features log updated; security rules updated, each with a comment saying why.
